1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:03,657
Here's how to order your own 3D figurine. Right on WhatsApp.

2
00:00:04,557 --> 00:00:07,254
Step one. Message us on WhatsApp, and say hi.

3
00:00:08,154 --> 00:00:11,736
Step two. Tell us what you want, like a couple figurine.

4
00:00:12,636 --> 00:00:14,619
Step three. Send one clear photo.

5
00:00:15,519 --> 00:00:20,872
Step four. In one to two minutes, you get two free previews. Stylized, and semi-realistic.

6
00:00:21,772 --> 00:00:27,822
Step five. Pick your favourite. Want changes? Outfit, colours, hair or pose. Just ask.

7
00:00:28,722 --> 00:00:36,405
Step six. Choose your size. Thirteen, fifteen, or eighteen centimetres. And add your names on the base. Free of cost.

8
00:00:37,305 --> 00:00:40,984
Step seven. Confirm your order. Free delivery across India.

9
00:00:41,884 --> 00:00:45,809
Then we send you a payment link, and start printing after your final approval.

10
00:00:46,709 --> 00:00:49,524
Comment below to get a DM. Or message us on WhatsApp.

